; The seven GPU particles collision and attractor nodes side by side, for the one variable no other
; golden moves: their editor gizmos (a box, three great circles, or a box with the SDF cell grid).
; Godot draws them for every node (ADR-0056), so the `unselected` golden shows all seven faint and the
; `select:` golden shows the SDF node at full alpha. No other scene shows these nodes with their
; gizmos on; each one draws nothing else. A small box sits at two opposite corners to frame the whole row.
